    "guide": {
        "title": "User Guide",
        "sub": "Simple explanation of the app",
        "short_desc": "A comprehensive guide explaining everything step by step.",
        "open_btn": "Open Guide",
        "s1_h": "1. Welcome to Transparency Go",
        "s1_b": "This app is a smart trading bot that operates on your personal Binance account.\n• Your funds always stay in your account (we do not hold them).\n• We do not request withdrawal permissions.\n• The bot opens trades, DCA, and sells automatically based on your settings.",
        "s2_h": "2. Quick Start (5 mins)",
        "s2_b": "Step 1: Create an account in the app.\nStep 2: Get API keys from Binance (enable Spot Trading + Read only, NO Withdraw).\nStep 3: Go to [Trading Settings], enter keys, and save.\nStep 4: Set trade size and max positions.\nStep 5: Click [Start Bot].",
        "s3_h": "3. Understanding Trading Settings",
        "s3_b": "• Trade Size: Amount used per buy (10 to 100 USDT).\n• Max Positions: Number of open trades at once (1 to 10).\n• Default is (0) to prevent auto-trading before you decide. You must set values and click Save to start.\n• A warning (yellow/red) appears if your settings will consume a large portion of your capital.",
        "s4_h": "4. Dashboard",
        "s4_b": "• Total Capital: Free balance + open positions value.\n• Exposure: Percentage of capital used in active trades.\n• Realized PnL: Net profit from closed trades only.\n• Click any card for full details.",
        "s5_h": "5. Trades & Auto-Resume",
        "s5_b": "• Bot opens trades, DCAs on dips, and takes profit (TP) at targets.\n• If the bot stops (e.g., update), it auto-resumes in 30 seconds unless manually stopped.",
        "s6_h": "6. Security & Privacy",
        "s6_b": "• API keys are encrypted before saving.\n• Passwords are protected with bcrypt.\n• No one can read your keys.\n• You can delete your data or stop the bot anytime.",
        "s7_h": "7. FAQ",
        "s7_b": "Q: Can I stop the bot? A: Yes, from the trading settings page.\nQ: What if internet drops? A: Trades stay in Binance; bot resumes on reconnect.\nQ: Are there fees? A: No trading fees from us. Only Binance standard fees.\nQ: How to delete account? A: From the [My Account] page."
    },
